    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all messes can be explained. But someone\u2019s gotta clean them up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a quiet town where the future came a little too fast, strange things tend to... happen. As part of the Purrrifiers crew \u2014 a semi-official cleaning team with questionable equipment and an even stranger cat-based support system \u2014 you and up to three friends are tasked with scrubbing the unexplainable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Weird substances. Odd clients. Sudden dimensional hiccups. It\u2019s all in a day\u2019s work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-op cleanup chaos meets light sci-fi mystery, in a world where no one asks why the vacuum purrs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/6418c4c4bc4e8baa34e2af260e5a963f.poster.avif?t=1749860676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/6418c4c4bc4e8baa34e2af260e5a963f.webm?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/6418c4c4bc4e8baa34e2af260e5a963f.mp4?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer Madness:</strong> Team up with up to 4 players in cooperative and competition modes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diverse Gameplay Modes:</strong> Enjoy a rich campaign mode, solo adventures, and various multiplayer options. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Interactive World:</strong> Engage with RAGDOLL characters, explore dynamic environments, and create your own chaos. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Upgrade &amp; Customize:</strong> Level up your character, expand your business, and unlock new costumes, tools, and stickers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cat Companions: </strong> Befriend and pet cats that assist you throughout your journey. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/4b5e3a701109ec3adefb7976e04896dd.poster.avif?t=1749860676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/4b5e3a701109ec3adefb7976e04896dd.webm?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/4b5e3a701109ec3adefb7976e04896dd.mp4?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ACTIVITIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve puzzles to access and clean different locations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clean, collect, and sort garbage. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drive various vehicles like garbage trucks, lawn mowers, street sweepers, boats, and drones. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize a wide array of cleaning tools from pressure washers to vacuum cleaners and stun guns. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/417def40d322f4d8a6c320d426ed5492.poster.avif?t=1749860676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/417def40d322f4d8a6c320d426ed5492.webm?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/417def40d322f4d8a6c320d426ed5492.mp4?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>VEHICLES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Garbage Trucks:</strong> Collect and recycle waste. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lawn Mowers:</strong> Enjoy relaxing lawn mowing sessions. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Street Sweepers:</strong> Compete in cleaning streets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Specialized Boats:</strong> Clean water bodies like Pac-Man. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drones:</strong> Navigate through foggy areas with precision. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/54f6cbfd9888178afb628d8fbd7e5c1e.poster.avif?t=1749860676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/54f6cbfd9888178afb628d8fbd7e5c1e.webm?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/54f6cbfd9888178afb628d8fbd7e5c1e.mp4?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TOOLS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pressure washers, sponges, vacuum cleaners, and more. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique tools like stun guns and shredders. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various chemicals and cleaning equipment. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cats that help you clean in ingenious ways. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore diverse areas including suburbs, towns, landfills, cinemas, forests, beaches, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each location offers unique challenges and hidden cats to find. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Micro and Macro Cleaning:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle both large-scale neighborhood cleanups and detailed cleaning in individual buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collaborate with your team, divide tasks, and watch out for quirky customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/12d16983da883890a508749a9843b58f.poster.avif?t=1749860676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/12d16983da883890a508749a9843b58f.webm?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/12d16983da883890a508749a9843b58f.mp4?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JOIN THE FUN!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the whimsical world of Purrrifiers where cleaning meets chaos, and every action is an opportunity for laughter and fun. Grab your friends, your tools, and your cats, and get ready to clean up the world one mess at a time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
