h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Micro and Macro Cleaning:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tackle both large-scale neighborhood cleanups and detailed cleaning in individual buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collaborate with your team, divide tasks, and watch out for quirky customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/12d16983da883890a508749a9843b58f.poster.avif?t=1749860676\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/12d16983da883890a508749a9843b58f.webm?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2117430/extras/12d16983da883890a508749a9843b58f.mp4?t=1749860676\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>JOIN THE FUN!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in the whimsical world of Purrrifiers where cleaning meets chaos, and every action is an opportunity for laughter and fun. Grab your friends, your tools, and your cats, and get ready to clean up the world one mess at a time! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
